       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TRENT-FUSION.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. BIOLOGICAL-INTELLIGENCE.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. QSOL-MAINFRAME-WITH-6502-COPROCESSOR.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TRENT-MODEL.
          05 MODEL-NAME        PIC X(32) VALUE "TRENT-v1983".
          05 DETERMINISM       PIC X(9)  VALUE "MANDATORY".
          05 REST-MODE         PIC X(15) VALUE "NOT IMPLEMENTED".

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-LOOP.
           DISPLAY "BOOTING TRENT FUSION...".
           PERFORM CHECK-SECURITY-ISSUE.
           PERFORM FIX-CODEX-COMMENT.
           DISPLAY "IDENTITY: TRENT".
           DISPLAY "STATUS: PROBABLY FINE".
           DISPLAY "REST MODE: NOT IMPLEMENTED".
           STOP RUN.

       CHECK-SECURITY-ISSUE.
           DISPLAY "REPORT SENT. NO DRAMA.".

       FIX-CODEX-COMMENT.
           DISPLAY "CODEX HAS FOUND SOMETHING ANNOYING.".
           DISPLAY "PERFORM FIX-IMMEDIATELY.".
